{
 "about": "Decade rules for worlds that run in a past year (dungeon/world/decades.py, ported from Prospero Companion's Back when). A modern city whose story clock reads a year before today takes on that year: the narrator is told the decade's things, slang, media and prices and what does not exist yet, and its narration is checked for things from a later year. Careers and pastimes with `years` ([from, until]) are only offered in those years; media titles count by their year. Nothing here applies in the present or in a city of another era.",
 "decades": {
  "1990s": {
   "from": 1990,
   "things": "Phones are landlines with answering machines, cordless handsets and pagers; car phones and brick-sized cell phones early, small Nokias by the late decade. Computers are beige desktops with floppy disks and CD-ROMs; the internet arrives mid-decade over dial-up (AOL, chat rooms, email for the few). Music on cassettes, CDs and Walkmans; films on VHS from the video store; photos on film, developed at the one-hour lab.",
   "picture": "It is {year}: clothes, hair, phones, cars and shop fronts are from the {part} 1990s, nothing newer."
  },
  "2000s": {
   "from": 2000,
   "things": "Phones are flip, candybar and slider phones with keypad texting (T9), ringtones and tiny cameras; BlackBerrys for business, the first iPhones only from mid-2007 and still rare. Computers are desktops and chunky laptops, dial-up giving way to broadband; people chat on AIM and MSN Messenger, keep MySpace and then Facebook pages, burn CDs, carry iPods, rent DVDs from Blockbuster or by mail from Netflix, and take pictures on small digital cameras.",
   "picture": "It is {year}: clothes, hair, phones, cars and shop fronts are from the {part} 2000s, nothing newer."
  },
  "2010s": {
   "from": 2010,
   "things": "Smartphones take over: iPhones and Androids, apps, texting with emoji, Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, later Snapchat; tablets from 2010. Music streams on Spotify and Pandora, films and series on Netflix; ride-hailing and dating apps arrive in the middle of the decade.",
   "picture": "It is {year}: clothes, hair, phones, cars and shop fronts are from the {part} 2010s, nothing newer."
  },
  "2020s": {
   "from": 2020,
   "things": "Smartphones everywhere, video calls, delivery and ride apps, streaming everything; masks and lockdowns in 2020 and 2021.",
   "picture": "It is {year}: clothes, hair, phones, cars and shop fronts are from the {part} 2020s, nothing newer."
  }
 },
